  "comparison": "ALICE displayed <dNch/deta> at |eta|<0.5 for the SAME eight FT0C classes, taken from the K0S yield abscissae. These are measured coordinates, not independent CMS centrality-bin values. Their experimental x errors and covariance were not extracted.",
